WEBVTT

00:00:00.580 --> 00:00:04.740
Hi, I'm Tilly! Showing someone your screen? Try the spotlight.

00:00:05.842 --> 00:00:08.082
Shake the mouse, and the spotlight comes on.

00:00:08.932 --> 00:00:12.212
The beam follows your pointer, and the rest of the screen dims.

00:00:18.343 --> 00:00:21.725
Shake it again, or press b in window mode, to switch it off.

00:00:23.346 --> 00:00:25.986
Want to try it? The install guide is right here.
